WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hi, my name is Britney, I'm a personal
trainer

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
and I reached out to Andy and his team a
couple months ago

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
to automate some of the services that I
currently provide

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
and to create a website and have majority

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
of my payments processed through that
website

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
to have more of a swift process with all
my clients.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I chose to go with Andy and his team

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
because I wanted something that is
obviously legally sound.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I've heard of some horror stories from
other personal trainers

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
that have their own websites and have had
issues with payments

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
and continuous payment plans.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
So that was something that was really
important to me

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
and they were able to do that really
efficiently.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Now that I've got that set up by Andy and
his team,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
I don't actually have to manually go in

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.000
and process any payments.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I can focus on my clients and leave that
to the website to do it automatically,

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
which is great and saves me some time to
focus on my actual business.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
It was really worth it for me, especially
in my industry.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
I no longer need to do half of the things
that I used to do.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
If you're looking for someone or a company
or a team to set up automatic payments

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
and make sure that things are legally
sound,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.706
then I would definitely recommend Andy and
his team.
